{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Defect 1: ImplementationWorkflow read file_impact off the ticket payload it fetched itself rather than the field already carried on the workflow input, and that fetch returned an empty list, so the declared paths never reached the commit. Defect 2: materialization.stage() committed every path git reported as changed, with no filter against the declaration."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933494797220001,"uuid":"1e3daf10-2b10-4dcc-917a-50e9917ceb07"}